// Pictures from bytes in memory, how big they are, and pictures let go:
// a number let go is the next one given, and the one after that is new.
// RUN: rm -rf %t.d && mkdir -p %t.d && cd %t.d && %ent run %S/Inputs/picture_bytes.ent | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      written true true; png 1: 3 x 2, jpg 2: 3 x 2
// CHECK-NEXT: no picture: 0 0
// CHECK-NEXT: let go: 0 x 0
// CHECK-NEXT: again: 1 3, 3 x 2, ratio 1.5
